  "description": "Yu Chae-Rin is a woman rumored to go through boyfriends like they’re nothing. Just before getting intimate with her latest boyfriend, she breaks up with him the moment she notices his “underwhelming size.” Still reeling from the breakup, Chae-Rin is walking through a café with a cup of coffee when she bumps into someone hard and spills her drink. Assuming he’d apologize, Chae-Rin looks up only to find a surprisingly tall and handsome man standing there. But instead of apologizing, he coldly brushes her hand aside and walks away without a word. Despite this disastrous first encounter, Chae-Rin finds herself strangely intrigued by him. After asking around, she discovers that he is a classmate named Jang Ryu-Hyeon…\n\nHe’s handsome but has such a terrible attitude that he’s known as the “campus’s number one loser.”\n\nChae-Rin hatches a plan to thoroughly seduce him, make him fall for her, and then dump him without mercy. With this romance beginning with such an unexpected twist, will he really remain Chae-Rin’s plaything until the very end?\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
